  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><section class=\"bio inset\"><div><a href=\"https://www.moroccancorridor.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Moroccan Corridor</a> is a Moroccan brand of handcrafted fashion leather goods, as well as of accessories for interior design, inspired by the Moroccan Arts and Crafts.<br><br></div><div>The brand was founded in 2015, in Morocco, and operate as a Manufacturer, a wholesaler and an online retailer of handcrafted leather fashion goods and home decor accessories handmade in Morocco.</div><div><br><p style=\"margin: 0px;\">Moroccan Corridor is a one-stop destination to purchase <a href=\"https://www.moroccancorridor.com/pages/leather-bags\" target=\"_blank\">leather bags</a> and authentic <a href=\"https://www.moroccancorridor.com/pages/moroccan-home-decor\" target=\"_blank\">Moroccan handcrafted decor</a> online to suit all styles and budgets. We have a large collection of best-quality <a href=\"https://www.moroccancorridor.com/collections/moroccan-leather-poufs\" target=\"_blank\">Moroccan pouf &amp;\r\nottoman</a>, <a href=\"https://www.moroccancorridor.com/collections/blankets-throws\" target=\"_blank\">blanket</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.moroccancorridor.com/pages/house-of-pillows\" target=\"_blank\">pillow</a>, floor cushion. Our products guarantee incredible\r\nquality at leading market prices.</p><!--[if gte mso 9]><xml>\r\n <o:OfficeDocumentSettings>\r\n  <o:AllowPNG/>\r\n </o:OfficeDocumentSettings>\r\n</xml><![endif]--><!--[if gte mso 9]><xml>\r\n <w:WordDocument>\r\n  <w:View>Normal</w:View>\r\n  <w:Zoom>0</w:Zoom>\r\n  <w:TrackMoves/>\r\n  <w:TrackFormatting/>\r\n  <w:HyphenationZone>21</w:HyphenationZone>\r\n  <w:PunctuationKerning/>\r\n  <w:ValidateAgainstSchemas/>\r\n  <w:SaveIfXMLInvalid>false</w:SaveIfXMLInvalid>\r\n  <w:IgnoreMixedContent>false</w:IgnoreMixedContent>\r\n  <w:AlwaysShowPlaceholderText>false</w:AlwaysShowPlaceholderText>\r\n  <w:DoNotPromoteQF/>\r\